 ","Your account"]}],[["$","p","0",{"children":"You must be 18 or older to book, or have a parent or guardian book for you. Keep your sign-in details private; you are responsible for what is done under your account. The details you give us â€” name, email, phone, number of participants â€” must be accurate, because providers rely on them."}]]]}],["$","div","pol_tc3_t",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"id":"policy-s3","style":{"fontSize":21,"marginBottom":10},"children":[3,". ","Bookings and confirmation"]}],[["$","p","0",{"children":"Activities and packages are carried out by independent local providers. When you book, we pass your request to the provider. A booking is confirmed only when the provider confirms it; we then tell you by email and in your account."}],["$","p","1",{"children":"While we wait for confirmation, the amount is held on your card and not charged. It is charged only after the provider confirms. If the provider does not confirm, the hold is released (see the payment policy)."}]]]}],["$","div","pol_tc4_t",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"id":"policy-s4","style":{"fontSize":21,"marginBottom":10},"children":[4,". ","Prices"]}],[["$","p","0",{"children":"Prices are shown in US dollars (USD). The total you agree to at checkout â€” including any fees or taxes shown there â€” is the price you pay. Prices on the site can change, but a change never affects a booking you have already placed."}]]]}],"$L3","$L4","$L5","$L6","$L7","$L8","$L9"]}],"$La"]}]]}]]}]}],null,"$Lb"]}],"isPartial":"$@c","staleTime":"$d","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$Le","isPartial":"$@f","staleTime":"$d","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L10","isPartial":"$@11","staleTime":"$d","varyParams":"$12"}],"isUpgradeableISRFallback":false,"a":"$@13","rootVaryParams":null,"needsRuntimeRequest":"$@14"}
